{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_056170","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"说起来，Huey给我的ID卡进不了研究所……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"嗯。我把他的卡作废了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"为什么？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"我怎么可能让那种家伙进我的研究所。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"你还真讨厌他。明明是做同类研究的同行。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"别开玩笑了。首先，我就受不了他那副畏畏缩缩的样子。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"一个男人，别偷偷摸摸写信，直接来见我、把心意说出来不行吗！？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"可卡都被你作废了，他也没法来见你吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"还有！他动不动就贬低自己，三句话不离“像我这种人……”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"为什么就不能对自己做的事情有点自信！？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"毕竟还有论文被盗用那件事……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"而且他根本没有主见。不管在NASA还是哥斯达黎加，都只会跟在人后面问：“喂，有没有什么我能帮忙的？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":142,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"为什么不堂堂正正摆出自己的论点，跟你正面交锋？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"这种事就连我也敬谢不敏……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"更离谱的是，别人给他起的绰号，他自己还高高兴兴地拿来用。我真搞不懂。也太没主见了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":123,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"原来“Huey”这个绰号是你起的……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":49,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"对。取自科幻电影《Silent Running》里的一台无人机器人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":74,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"无人机器人？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"一种作业机器人。它总跟在人后面等别人下指令，跟他实在太像了，所以我借用了这个名字。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":123,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"那是部美国电影，导演Douglas Trumbull曾负责《2001：太空漫游》的特效。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":92,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"真意外。科学家都这么喜欢科幻吗……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"而且说到底！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"还有？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"说到底，他是个男人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"……可你刚才明明说过“一个男人就该……”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"……不过，作为科学家他确实很优秀。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"没有<R=爬虫类,REPTILE> Pod，<R=哺乳类,MAMMAL> Pod就无法运作。就像大脑不可能脱离脑干和小脑存在一样。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=爬虫类,REPTILE>\", \"<R=哺乳类,MAMMAL>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":133,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"设计出它的技术，我还是承认的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":28,"cn_text":"真少见。你居然会夸别人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":29,"cn_text":"哼。我只是在客观评价。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":30,"cn_text":"我喜欢靠自己的意志向前走的人。如果只会被形势推着走，那就没什么好谈的。首先得从这一点开始。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":135,"review_flag":""}]}